IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FIXTURE-BASE.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
SELECT INFILE ASSIGN TO "input.dat" ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS IN-STATUS.
SELECT OUTFILE ASSIGN TO "output.dat" ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS OUT-STATUS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD INFILE.
01 IN-REC.
05 IN-NUM PIC 9(2).
FD OUTFILE.
01 OUT-REC.
05 OUT-NUM PIC 9(2).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-STATUS PIC X(2).
01 OUT-STATUS PIC X(2).
01 WORK-NUM PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
01 TEXT-VAL PIC X(3) VALUE "ABC".
01 OPEN-FLAG PIC X(1) VALUE "N".
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
OPEN INPUT INFILE
IF IN-STATUS = "00"
    MOVE "Y" TO OPEN-FLAG
END-IF
IF OPEN-FLAG = "Y"
    CLOSE INFILE
END-IF
STOP RUN.
